ask(c,'For one revolute joint with M=2 kg·m², τ′=3 rad/s², V=1 N·m, G=4 N·m and F=0.5 N·m, what torque is commanded?', ['11.5 N·m','8.5 N·m','6.5 N·m','0.5 N·m'],['2×3+1+4+0.5=11.5 N·m.','This adds virtual acceleration without multiplying by inertia.','This omits V and G.','This subtracts the load terms from the inertial torque.'],kind='numerical',formula=[DYN,ERR],pages=[730,731],steps=['ατ′=2×3=6 N·m.','β=1+4+0.5=5.5 N·m.','τ=6+5.5=11.5 N·m.'])
